ledger microservices using Node.js and PostgreSQL. Currently, I’m a Senior Backend Engineer at LedgerLoop, where I manage a ledger service that processes around 2 million transactions daily. I implemented Redis caching and idempotency keys, which reduced our p95 latency from 480 milliseconds to just 120 milliseconds. Prior to that, at Swiftcart, I developed order and inventory REST APIs using Express.js and containerized our services with Docker. I’m passionate about optimizing performance and building scalable systems.', 0.94);
